# Every law these queries claim, with its verdict. One row per (law, subject): which law, which
# relation or instance, whether it holds, and the counts or figures that decide it.
#
# A defect in the queries
#   examples/soundness reports this relation, and it answers a question neither checks/ nor
#   arithmetic/ asks. A check says the document contradicts the model. An arithmetic site says a
#   figure cannot be worked out here. This says a query does not compute what it claims to: a defect
#   in the queries rather than in the evidence, and the only one of the three that accuses nobody's
#   filing. `conforms` is the one law about the evidence, and algebra/roster.sqlc says why it sits
#   here.
#
# What every law returns
#   One plain SELECT, with no leading WITH, returning exactly `(law, subject, holds, detail)`, and
#   `holds` NULL only on the roster row that found nothing to check. checks/ and arithmetic/ keep
#   the same shape for the same reason: a law with no subjects must report that it checked nothing
#   rather than vanish from a GROUP BY. `law` is the roster's `slug` and not its statement, because
#   several laws share one statement.
-- algebra/roster.sqlc joined to each law's own subjects.
:union(ALL algebra/class_domain.sqlc,
           algebra/dimension_use.sqlc,
           algebra/compose_decomposition.sqlc,
           algebra/decomposition.sqlc,
           algebra/cycle_space.sqlc,
           algebra/composition_kernel.sqlc,
           algebra/composition_row_space.sqlc,
           algebra/composition_image.sqlc,
           algebra/composition_closure.sqlc,
           algebra/layer_units.sqlc,
           algebra/owed_equality.sqlc,
           algebra/leaves.sqlc,
           algebra/jagged_layers.sqlc,
           algebra/composed_quantities.sqlc,
           algebra/integrity.sqlc,
           algebra/carried.sqlc,
           algebra/owed_remainder.sqlc,
           algebra/settled_remainders.sqlc,
           algebra/borne.sqlc,
           algebra/arithmetic_class.sqlc,
           algebra/remainder_standing.sqlc,
           algebra/exposure_standing.sqlc,
           algebra/searches.sqlc,
           algebra/part_regimes.sqlc,
           algebra/crossed_remainder.sqlc,
           algebra/exposure.sqlc,
           algebra/remainder_decomposes.sqlc,
           algebra/sawtooth.sqlc,
           algebra/composed_quantum.sqlc,
           algebra/fusion_sum.sqlc,
           algebra/composed_remainder.sqlc,
           algebra/conforms.sqlc,
           algebra/fit_domain.sqlc,
           algebra/absences_filed.sqlc,
